+
+### remove-project
+
+> Unlink a project from an initiative
+
+```
+Usage:   linear initiative remove-project <initiative> <project>
+
+Description:
+
+  Unlink a project from an initiative
+
+Options:
+
+  -h, --help           - Show this help.                      
+  --workspace  <slug>  - Target workspace (uses credentials)  
+  -y, --force          - Skip confirmation prompt
