+
+## Usage
+
+```
+Usage:   linear project
+
+Description:
+
+  Manage Linear projects
+
+Options:
+
+  -h, --help           - Show this help.                      
+  --workspace  <slug>  - Target workspace (uses credentials)  
+
+Commands:
+
+  list                  - List projects                  
+  view, v  <projectId>  - View project details           
